WEBVTT

00:00:08,980 --> 00:00:12,260
What are some best ways to deal with stress?

00:00:12,900 --> 00:00:24,260
So that's a good question. We all have stress. Certainly when we get to diagnosis, it's a cause of stress, you know,

00:00:25,260 --> 00:00:30,580
dealing with other people in a cause of stress, dealing with work issues could be a cause of stress.

00:00:32,060 --> 00:00:38,860
So there's lots of causes of stress. So always when you're dealing with anything, you want to try to

00:00:39,860 --> 00:00:48,860
do your best to mitigate the cause. So if the cause of my stress is, you know,

00:00:49,860 --> 00:00:58,860
what unhappy relationship, try to work on that relationship. If you cause your stresses too much work at the office,

00:00:59,860 --> 00:01:06,860
try to deal with that and talk to your boss or whatever. You know, you try to get to the cause always when you're dealing with anything.

00:01:06,860 --> 00:01:13,860
So that's just your health issues. You're trying to deal with causative factors. That's going to be the best way to deal with it.

00:01:14,860 --> 00:01:21,860
So let's say you've done all of that, but it's just this inner angst, this inner stress in my body. I just feel fatigued.

00:01:22,860 --> 00:01:30,860
You might have symptoms of adrenal burnout or adrenal fatigue. What are some ways to deal with that?

00:01:30,860 --> 00:01:40,860
Well, from a nutritional standpoint, diet is really important. So if, you know, you're eating foods that are highly inflammatory,

00:01:41,860 --> 00:01:48,860
that's going to make it worse. We tend to crave sweets and salty things when our adrenals are fatigued.

00:01:49,860 --> 00:01:57,860
So that is, you know, what is the science of adrenal fatigue is craving salty foods.

00:01:57,860 --> 00:02:10,860
That's not the only reason why you would crave salty foods, but it is a sign. So dealing with inflammatory causes in our diet, typically like food sensitivities

00:02:11,860 --> 00:02:15,860
and things to calm down the inflammation that could be going in our gut, that could help.

00:02:15,860 --> 00:02:27,860
From a nutritional, nutraceutical standpoint, taking adaptogenic herbs that could help balance your hormones. That could help.

00:02:28,860 --> 00:02:38,860
If you're interested in doing objective testing with stress, getting the Dutch test done looks at all your hormones, including cortisol curve.

00:02:38,860 --> 00:02:48,860
So your tested cortisol levels four times during the day, it should have a nice certain looking curve should be normal.

00:02:49,860 --> 00:03:01,860
And you want to measure that so you can see, you know, if there is an issue with your adrenal hormones at all, it can be other hormones that could be causing it too.

00:03:01,860 --> 00:03:15,860
So those are the first things I think of. If you think of like what is a supplement that I could do, take to help with stress, anti-inflammatories, like curcumid, as well, you know, things like that.

00:03:16,860 --> 00:03:24,860
And then adaptogens are the most common thing that you would use for helping with stress to help balance your hormones.

